{"authoredAt":"2026-08-23T19:44:38.151Z","conclusion":"findings","findings":[{"category":"adversarial","desc":"packages/main/src/core/native-review-evidence.ts:256: REVIEW-gate verification rechecks the native attestation with requireFresh:false but never verifies the one-shot nonce-consumption record created by native-review-attestation.ts:162. A copied signed attestation can therefore be replayed in replacement local evidence after its original record is removed, and review-run.ts:1574 will accept it. Require the persisted nonce/digest consumption record at gate time before native evidence is admissible.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/native-review-attestation.ts","packages/main/src/core/native-review-evidence.ts","packages/main/src/core/review-run.ts"],"severity":"high"},{"category":"adversarial","desc":"packages/main/src/core/provider-process-registry.ts:251: a same-host lock holder whose PID has been reused by an unrelated process is always classified active because processStartTimeMs is compared only when holder.pid is this process. That bypasses stale-age recovery forever and makes provider admission/release mutations time out until the unrelated PID exits. Revalidate foreign-PID start time, and treat a mismatch as stale.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/provider-process-registry.ts"],"severity":"medium"},{"category":"adversarial","desc":"packages/main/src/core/managed-host-run.ts:2258: readManagedHostRunOutput reloads and JSON-parses the entire retained output journal before slicing afterSequence; foreground attachment drains it in a while(hasMore) loop at handlers/host-run.ts:632. Many small provider chunks therefore make live-output delivery O(n²) synchronous parsing and can delay status/output handling despite the retention cap. Use an incremental byte-offset/sequence reader or otherwise bound historical parsing per page.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/managed-host-run.ts","packages/main/src/handlers/host-run.ts"],"severity":"medium"}],"lane":"lattice-review-quality","providerAgent":"lattice-review-quality","readLog":{"digest":"33adf7050104badb67702c19c9de913ff834b92af1f97a1975a2bf1e2e2c0173","filesReadFully":[".lattice/story/actives/B-137a/background.md",".lattice/story/actives/B-137a/plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/managed-cross-provider-cli-execution.md","docs/requirements/decisions/review-run-binding-race.md","packages/main/src/core/native-review-attestation.ts","packages/main/src/core/native-review-evidence.ts"],"filesTriagedByName":["docs/host-run-usage.md","docs/requirements/decisions/cli-engine-english-open-source-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-codex-command-boundary-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-llm-usage-ledger-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-midflight-story-repair-and-gitroot-worktree-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/multi-host-keyword-candidate-spec-routing-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-admissibility-hardening-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-or-stop-agent-prompt-consolidation-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-or-stop-thin-entrypoint-contract-migration-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proofstory-acceptance-topology-and-pre-review-gates-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proofstory-intent-collision-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/review-assurance-floor-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md","docs/requirements/decisions/tier-c-crosshost-quorum-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/workflow-convergence-failure-remediation-execution-plan.md","packages/main/src/cli-engine.ts","packages/main/src/cli/command-catalog.ts","packages/main/src/core/autopilot-executor.ts","packages/main/src/core/codex-review-leaf.ts